<metadata><name>Sand Mountain from Little Nash Sno-Park</name><desc>or-vielbig-2e:239-2: route read from the book's text and sketch map. One trkseg per waypoint pair, in order; segment sources are in the trk desc. Geometry from OSM (ODbL, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors) and USFS EDW (public domain) where marked; 'straight' segments are off-trail connectors, not traced.</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="44.432536" lon="-121.958240"><ele>1132.5</ele><name>Little Nash Sno-Park</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin (owner's local knowledge); confidence: high; pdf_page: 241; book_elev_ft: 3760; quote: Little Nash Sno-Park at 3,760 feet is 0.8 mile west of Santiam Junction</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.399600" lon="-121.952359"><ele>1252.7</ele><name>Road 2676 / NF 866 junction (turn east)</name><desc>source: OSM node 3707336632, start of NF 2676-866; also USFS EDW junction of 2676000 and trail 3535 (Santiam Wagon Road East, which runs west from here); confidence: medium; pdf_page: 241; book_elev_ft: 4000; quote: It follows roughly the 4,000-foot contour 2.5 miles south, then turns east and joins the Old Santiam Wagon Road</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.394170" lon="-121.918350"><ele>1429.9</ele><name>NF 866 / NF 810 junction, pass north of Sand Mountain</name><desc>source: OSM node 3707335931, end of NF 2676-866 on NF 2690-810 (Sand Mountain Road); confidence: medium; pdf_page: 241; book_elev_ft: 4560; quote: to a 4,560-foot pass north of Sand Mountain (map 51: 4620', 3.8 from Little Nash Sno-Park)</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.384645" lon="-121.927863"><ele>1654.3</ele><name>Sand Mountain Lookout (south summit)</name><desc>source: OSM way 822074818 Sand Mountain Lookout; GNIS summit node 357287855 is 40 m away; confidence: high; pdf_page: 241; book_elev_ft: 5459; quote: The summit of Sand Mountain, 5,459 feet, is reached by a road on the northeast side. In 1990 a new fire-lookout cabin was built on the south summit</desc></wpt>
<trk><name>Sand Mountain from Little Nash Sno-Park</name><desc>1. Little Nash Sno-Park -&gt; Road 2676 / NF 866 junction (turn east): osm (high), 2.62 mi | 2. Road 2676 / NF 866 junction (turn east) -&gt; NF 866 / NF 810 junction, pass north of Sand Mountain: osm (medium), 1.86 mi | 3. NF 866 / NF 810 junction, pass north of Sand Mountain -&gt; Sand Mountain Lookout (south summit): osm (high), 1.85 mi</desc>
